      "entries": [
        "The Prince changes into his humanoid shape, hybrid shape, or wolf shape. While in hybrid shape, he gains a jaws Strike. While in animal shape, he gains the effects of a 5th-level casting of animal form to become a canine. He prefers fighting in hybrid shape."
      ]
    },
    {
