      "entries": [
        "The Prince of Wolves twists his weapon in the wounds inflicted on the creature he just struck, then rips the weapon free. As he does so, he tears free fragments of that creature's fate, leaving them with ill fortune. The creature takes 12d6 mental damage (DC 38 basic Will save); on a failure, the creature also becomes doomed 1 (doomed 2 on a critical failure). The creature is thereafter immune to Tear Fate."
      ],
